{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "a4da4f554cba12b7df1fb574c02e845896734e0192c439e57b18b371aa8d80b4", "ja": "結成！　魅力の大渋滞ユニット？", "zh": "结成！魅力大堵车组合？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "773190e18f3785a4ca7b46ac703d2c8067812c50b075ba66849d2c2458e6af9c", "ja": "天体公演で新ユニット『ジェミニ』を組む事\r\nになった桃子、風花、このみ。大人っぽい曲\r\nをもらって、桃子は喜ぶ。大手フラワーショ\r\nップのタイアップCMも決定し、ユニット活\r\n動に意欲を見せるアイドル達。", "zh": "桃子、风花、木实决定在天体公演中\n组成新组合“双子座”。分到了一首\n成熟风格的歌曲，桃子十分开心。\n她们还确定将接拍大型花店的商业合作广告，\n偶像们对接下来的组合活动展现出了十足的干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c8eb4bdb5938f373906038cd174c79a28a76c9600b095fa9724ad57c5c25f0e6", "ja": "（今日は、新曲を歌うメンバーと打ち合わせだ。\nみんなは集まってるかな？）", "zh": "（今天要和演唱新歌的成员们开会。大家都到齐了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "c4315d1db8d6207d794929eab0efc13de7b3800dcfbd67cc6ad2507df6be4124", "ja": "このみさん、なに見てるの？", "zh": "好美姐，你在看什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "bd4ed54671c3170dac16a8a055e95212609326309c2e9db14bff438c99d83aaf", "ja": "通販サイトよ。この小花柄のワンピース、素敵ね！\nでも、セクシーな私には似合わないかしら？", "zh": "是购物网站哦。这件小碎花连衣裙真漂亮！不过，适合性感的我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "2ecb244e878227c93e429b56348286ebf162f3a897859307a16c254ddba8f9f9", "ja": "そんなことないんじゃない？\nこのみさんは可愛い服も似合うと思うよ。", "zh": "才不是那样吧？\n我觉得，这种可爱的衣服也很适合这个み小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "a7cf5254407ac57878fc96c31c1d120331d0d8fdc73a2a8a94bc6038c7e6796a", "ja": "あら、嬉しいこと言ってくれるじゃない♪\nそれなら……桃子ちゃんも一緒に着てみない？", "zh": "哎呀，你可真会说让人开心的话♪  \n既然这样……桃子也要不要一起穿穿看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "7177bd5cb40820c5bd79fa59dabf4705e33c9f831c952e4fc1951f2e92a4e871", "ja": "えっ、桃子も？\n別にいいけど……大人っぽく見えるかな？", "zh": "诶，桃子也要？\n倒是没什么……看起来会不会更像大人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "43831849e122ca9f97ffbb365d0ad512dfd2cdb6894979659e240f05f0bfe469", "ja": "このみさんと桃子ちゃんのおそろいコーデかぁ……。\nきっと、双子の姉妹みたいで可愛いと思うな♪", "zh": "和木实和桃子穿一样的搭配啊……。\n我觉得一定会像双胞胎姐妹一样可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "60dc2b54053e04117a81c0b4131054c517df84b7ef6796f45bd0b4c35ba76223", "ja": "ちょっと、風花ちゃん！　姉妹はともかく、\n私と桃子ちゃんが双子ってどういうこと！？", "zh": "等等，风花！姐妹什么的先不说，\n我和桃子是双胞胎又是怎么回事？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ea0bf572058dff30d3dcd9f70c421f700703f8d2c3c446dfeb32ed74afffb70b", "ja": "えっ！　そ、それは、えーと……。", "zh": "诶！那、那个，这个嘛……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1009_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3d5f4101ca33ee63ceeff29792a5d35914fc2a1c5f46199bba97923e09ae3ee8", "ja": "お疲れさま。\n……うん、みんな揃ってるな。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n……嗯，大家都到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "191f14792b46bb4153da8ec5037b0033a6c1d82e8ff538fb18ffb0b675c1af16", "ja": "今日は時間どおりだね、お兄ちゃん！\nこのみさん、風花さんも、打ち合わせ始めよう？", "zh": "今天来得很准时嘛，哥哥！\n我们和好美姐、风花姐也都到齐了，开始开会吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1e044e9869e69d1d473a79463a18d0720fda630923784b131d24692aeb781775", "ja": "今回は、天体公演の話だ。\nこの3人で、ユニットを組んで欲しいと思って。", "zh": "这次要谈的是天体公演的事。希望你们这3个人组成一个组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "0f071e552ee6f81a0a9b7f76abf52a5730d2b41a8a03d31a2c1c4068e2038316", "ja": "私たちでユニット……\n可愛いと清楚とセクシーてんこ盛りユニットね！", "zh": "我们来组合唱团……\n可爱、清纯、性感，全都堆在一起的组合呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "456fcba7c2399b43960a710ee19788c49b983b91d948bee5112095499ba34445", "ja": "なんだか魅力の大渋滞ですね……。\nそうなると、ユニットの方向性もそんな感じですか？", "zh": "总觉得魅力都堵在一起了呢……\n这么一来，组合的方向也是这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4b0f40d89d94792b655951cca5b257d8aa9baa9fdc58800d43dfc04c25e01915", "ja": "いつもならそうなんだけど……。\nまずは、デモを聞いてみてくれないか？", "zh": "平时的话确实会是那样……。\n不过首先，能不能先听听Demo？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3e3d56fa9e3a3035b1aa30138890d5bdd8486775946b4604570b7d6317ac03d7", "ja": "わあ～、素敵……♪\nしっとりとした大人っぽい曲ですね！", "zh": "哇～好棒……♪\n是一首舒缓又成熟的歌曲呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "b785bb5d065f4c192d75100af15ce580bdc72573610c1f228c01a2a12f2f3c48", "ja": "うん……いいんじゃない？　お兄ちゃん。桃子、\nこういう大人っぽい曲、歌ってみたかったんだ。", "zh": "嗯……不是挺好的吗？哥哥。桃子一直想试着唱唱看这种成熟风格的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4699b5d96ec636ec2f29d635cf2f07431635cfbf25886978e2f84c8dd8fe73a0", "ja": "ああ。前に、そう言っていたのを思い出したんだ。\nそれにこの3人なら、声のバランスもいいし。", "zh": "啊。我想起你之前说过这件事。\n而且这3个人的话，声音的平衡也很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "f56369f9fda7f2b0fe32d1114125daa4a7cbda53e5158aec7a44593549f5e9f4", "ja": "桃子の新曲じゃないのは、ちょっと残念だけど……\nでも、大人っぽい3人で歌うのもいいよね！", "zh": "虽然不是桃子的新歌，还是有点遗憾……不过，由3个很有大人气质的人来唱，也不错吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "17881a2829a29c9df399cbe11c3c2a26cefc8306c032681c7a81dea8021950a9", "ja": "ええ、そうね。桃子ちゃんなら、私たちと組んでも、\nきっとアダルティに歌えると思うわ！", "zh": "嗯，是啊。桃子的话，就算和我们组队，也一定能唱出成熟风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "b3ff920812b361934e37e313ea951cab31c09c6665a99e8a942000f995227f0d", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　……ふふっ♪", "zh": "是、是这样吗？……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c23f4460ec60882953d10c03279d95bd464bfbf7de3168dd551ab2fa0a3381d5", "ja": "それと、大手フラワーショップのタイアップが\n決まってね。そのCMの仕事もしてもらうことになる。", "zh": "另外，大型花店的合作也已经定下来了。到时候还要请你来拍那个广告。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "80df465c079f1d51e5666313ea206693af95edb1771d3d9426eaf7121070c11c", "ja": "フラワーショップのCM……！\nすごくいいお仕事ですね！　私、精一杯頑張ります♪", "zh": "花店的广告……！\n真是特别棒的工作呢！我会竭尽全力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "882c738356c5e8f80bbfe571c10f85d55acbc39f7e8d85b8c7c110e261e907c9", "ja": "桃子、学校でお花のお世話係したことあるんだ。\nだからお花のことならまかせて！", "zh": "桃子以前在学校负责照料过花。\n所以关于花的事就交给桃子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "e1787948d3de5f53250bac888f2b473d1a48d6582a9a1d3888fffa00ff00492e", "ja": "このみさん、風花さん、\nわからないことがあったら、桃子に聞いてね！", "zh": "好啦，这个美姐姐、风花姐姐，要是有不懂的地方就问桃子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "382ce1af0f5a220ea48293d03f5deb87685f7cd4614a9ac8fda7fdc4358f3c30", "ja": "うん。頼りにしてるね、桃子ちゃん♪", "zh": "嗯。那就拜托你了，桃子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "202d4454ae90c90dd3c849f6d5430ce2af2c5005aeb5824e2c9b28c2dd29cc6c", "ja": "ええ。それじゃ、みんなで頑張りましょう！", "zh": "嗯。就拜托你了，桃子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "1686046d13bdb58bc714f7653b989089e41ada081bbf45e2daca667ed741313c", "ja": "（風花とこのみさんと一緒なら、\n桃子もきっと、楽しくユニット活動ができるだろう）", "zh": "（和风花、木实一起的话，桃子一定也能开心地进行组合活动吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0224_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0224_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "df5e1981e784f9f85a665bd55b49ae170fa01494ebdcfea1484f912943aa07fb", "ja": "（関係性も築けているし、モチベーションも高い。\nこのユニットがどんな花を咲かせるのか楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（大家已经建立起良好的关系，积极性也很高。真期待这个组合会绽放出怎样的花朵啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
